<main class="vstory">
  <section class="vstory__hero vstory__hero--minimal">
<div class="vstory__wrap"><p class="vstory__eyebrow">Vanaya</p><h1>Our Story</h1><div class="vstory__divider"></div><p class="vstory__intro">A return to timeless Ayurvedic rituals crafted for modern living.</p></div></section>

  <section class="vstory__origin vstory__wrap">
    <div class="vstory__label">01 · The Vanaya Story</div>
    <div class="vstory__prose"><h2>Nature already gives our skin so much. We simply chose to remember.</h2><p>Vanaya was born from a simple idea: in a world constantly chasing the next acid and the next active, there is value in returning to our roots. Every Vanaya bottle carries that idea forward—not as a trend, but as a thoughtful return.</p><p>It is a mother’s wisdom, bottled: natural, honest and created for real skin. We choose naturally rooted formulas, ingredients people can recognise, and recipes that respect the skin rather than overwhelm it.</p><blockquote>Vanaya is not here to reinvent skincare. We are here to remind you what it was always meant to be.</blockquote></div>
  </section>

  <section class="vstory__belief">
    <div class="vstory__belief-image vstory__belief-image--editorial"><img src="{{ 'vanaya-our-story-editorial-v2918.webp' | asset_url }}" width="1600" height="1600" loading="lazy" alt="Our Story — Vanaya rituals rooted in Ayurveda"></div>
    <div class="vstory__belief-copy"><p class="vstory__kicker">The people behind Vanaya</p><h2>One belief, thoughtfully shared.</h2><p>Vanaya was shaped by people who shared one uncomfortable observation: potent, pure and effective skincare had somehow become a luxury available only to a few.</p><p>Our purpose is simple—to bring nature’s most considered ingredients back to people without compromising efficacy, quality or honesty. Premium should feel exceptional, not unreachable; natural should never mean diluted.</p><div class="vstory__principles"><span>Real botanicals</span><span>Purposeful formulation</span><span>Honest sourcing</span><span>Accessible luxury</span></div></div>
  </section>

  <section class="vstory__ingredients vstory__wrap">
    <header><p class="vstory__kicker">Our hero actives</p><h2>Ingredients that earn their place.</h2><p>Chosen for what they genuinely contribute to a ritual—not simply for how impressive they sound on a label.</p></header>
    <div class="vstory__ingredient-grid">
      <article><img src="{{ 'vanaya-product-sea-buckthorn.webp' | asset_url }}" width="700" height="700" loading="lazy" alt="Sea Buckthorn oil"><span>01</span><h3>Sea Buckthorn</h3><p>Naturally rich in omega fatty acids, including omega-7, to support softness, nourishment and the skin’s moisture barrier.</p><small>Best for: dry, dull or barrier-stressed skin</small></article>
      <article><img src="{{ 'vanaya-product-kumkumadi.webp' | asset_url }}" width="700" height="700" loading="lazy" alt="Kesar and Kumkumadi ritual"><span>02</span><h3>Saffron · Kesar</h3><p>The celebrated heart of Kumkumadi rituals, traditionally valued for helping revive the appearance of dull, uneven-looking skin.</p><small>Best for: dullness, uneven tone and mature skin</small></article>
      <article><img src="{{ 'vanaya-product-haridradyam.webp' | asset_url }}" width="700" height="700" loading="lazy" alt="Haridra turmeric ritual"><span>03</span><h3>Turmeric · Haridra</h3><p>A classical botanical known for its calming and purifying character, selected for balanced care of blemish-prone skin.</p><small>Best for: oily, congested or blemish-prone skin</small></article>
      <article><img src="{{ 'vanaya-product-resurfacing.webp' | asset_url }}" width="700" height="700" loading="lazy" alt="Manjishta skincare ritual"><span>04</span><h3>Manjishta</h3><p>An Ayurvedic botanical traditionally used in complexion rituals to support clearer-looking, more even and composed skin.</p><small>Best for: uneven-looking, combination or mature skin</small></article>
      <article><img src="{{ 'vanaya-product-dark-circle.webp' | asset_url }}" width="700" height="700" loading="lazy" alt="Caffeine under eye ritual"><span>05</span><h3>Caffeine</h3><p>A well-studied cosmetic active chosen to help the under-eye area appear fresher, less puffy and more rested.</p><small>Best for: tired-looking eyes, puffiness and dark circles</small></article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="vstory__journey">
    <header><p class="vstory__kicker">From source to skin</p><h2>Considered at every step.</h2></header>
    <div><article><b>01</b><h3>Source</h3><p>Trusted growers and sourcing partners help us identify botanicals selected for quality and potency.</p></article><article><b>02</b><h3>Formulate</h3><p>Ayurvedic principles are refined with modern precision, purposeful concentrations and no unnecessary shortcuts.</p></article><article><b>03</b><h3>Manufacture</h3><p>Experienced, quality-certified manufacturing partners follow controlled standards for consistency in every batch.</p></article><article><b>04</b><h3>Deliver</h3><p>Every order is packed with care so the ritual reaches you fresh, intact and ready to become yours.</p></article></div>
  </section>
  <section class="vstory__closing"><p>We are not chasing the next innovation.</p><h2>We are returning to the one nature already gave us.</h2><a class="vanaya-button-v20" href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}"><span>Explore the range</span></a></section>
</main>
